T. To kick. Devon.\n\nUnto another she dyde as moche\n\nThe Complaynte of them that ben to late Marved. POCHEE. A dish in ancient cookery consisting\n\nFor they love none but for theyr poche.\n\nprincipally of poached eggs. Pegge.\n\nPOCHIN.\n\nPOCHERS. Potters\n\nPOCHIT. pollard tree. Linc.",
